Files in this repository that derive from ALCE:

  scripts/eval_citation.py     adapted from ALCE eval.py
  taxreasoning/alce_utils.py   normalize_answer / remove_citations, verbatim
                               from ALCE utils.py
  taxreasoning/methods.py      the INTERACT and INLINESEARCH multi-turn
                               protocols. The action vocabulary
                               ("Check: Document [i]" / "Search: query" /
                               "Output:" / "End.") is taken from ALCE's
                               prompts/*_interact_doc_id.json and
                               prompts/*_interact_search.json and translated
                               to this task: Chinese tax questions, a numeric
                               final answer, and no citation markers.

Each file carries the attribution in its module docstring, together with a
description of what was changed relative to upstream.

